      "id": "Y1mJI",
      "text": "$25$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\begin{aligned} & \\mathrm{Sn}=\\frac{1}{2}+\\frac{1}{6}+\\frac{1}{12}+\\frac{1}{20} \\ldots . \\mathrm{N} \\text { terms } \\\\ & \\mathrm{S}_{2025}=\\sum_{\\mathrm{n}=1}^{2025} \\frac{1}{\\mathrm{n}(\\mathrm{n}+1)}=\\sum_{\\mathrm{n}=1}^{2025}\\left(\\frac{1}{\\mathrm{n}}-\\frac{1}{\\mathrm{n}+1}\\right) \\\\ & =\\left(\\frac{1}{1}-\\frac{1}{2}\\right)+\\left(\\frac{1}{2}-\\frac{1}{3}\\right) \\quad \\ldots \\cdots\\left(\\frac{1}{2025}-\\frac{1}{2026}\\right)\\end{aligned}$\n\n\n$\\begin{aligned}\n& =\\frac{2025}{2026} \\\\\n& \\sqrt{2026 . \\mathrm{S}_{2025}}=\\sqrt{2025}=45\n\\end{aligned}$\n\nGiven : $\\frac{6}{2}[-2 p+(6-1) p]=45$\n$\\begin{aligned}\n& 9 \\mathrm{p}=45 \\\\\n& \\mathrm{p}=5 \\\\\n& \\left|\\mathrm{~A}_{20}-\\mathrm{A}_{15}\\right|=|-5+19 \\times 5|-[-5+14 \\times 5] \\\\\n& =|90-65| \\\\\n& =25\n\\end{aligned}$",
    "image": null
  },
